cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Augur in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Augur"
abstract: >-
  Augur estimates what an ideal quantum computer would measure, using classical
  simulators, and tells you how far each number can be trusted. It runs more than one
  method, climbs each up a ladder of settings until the value stops moving, and returns
  every value with an empirical error bar and a trust label.
type: software
authors:
